    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Feature: Explore the Visual World with In-Place Screen Translation</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/4e03bdf895ecf120944ae5dbf32c4506.poster.avif?t=1752102347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/4e03bdf895ecf120944ae5dbf32c4506.webm?t=1752102347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/4e03bdf895ecf120944ae5dbf32c4506.mp4?t=1752102347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/c71d3c19650968506c850d4bb43a8209.poster.avif?t=1752102347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/c71d3c19650968506c850d4bb43a8209.webm?t=1752102347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/c71d3c19650968506c850d4bb43a8209.mp4?t=1752102347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the groundbreaking In-Place Screen Translation feature added to our application! Now, you can translate not only audio but also the text on your screen in real-time. With a single press of a hotkey, you can have the text on your screen replaced with its translated versions while preserving their original positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How does this feature work?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you press the hotkey, our application takes a snapshot of the entire screen, intelligently detects all the text on it, translates it to the target language, and then erases the original text to place the translations in their spot. This way, you'll feel as if the content was in your language from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited Use Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Translation:</strong> Understand game menus, character dialogues, inventory descriptions, and more instantly in your language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Film and Video Translation:</strong> Easily comprehend on-screen text in foreign films or documentaries without subtitles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Webtoons, Manga, and Comics:</strong> Follow your favorite visual stories without language barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Applications and Software:</strong> Use the interfaces of foreign programs effortlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press your hotkey and step into a new world where every text on your screen instantly makes sense!</p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Down Language Barriers: Translate Everything You See and Hear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Translate is a powerful AI tool that instantly converts everything from games and movies to live streams and any text on your screen into a language you understand. You no longer have to miss out on content just because you don't know the language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Can You Do with Live Translate?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Live Audio Translation:</strong> Captures any audio from your system (games, movies, streams) and turns it into live subtitles in over 50 languages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Screenshot (OCR) Translation:</strong> Instantly select and translate text from game interfaces, manga, webtoons, or images.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featured Use Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Games:</strong> Un-translated JRPGs, story-rich indie titles, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Media:</strong> Movies, series, anime, and documentaries without subtitles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Live Streams:</strong> Follow foreign Twitch and YouTube streamers in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Visual Novels:</strong> Easily read dialogues in manga, webtoons, and comics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Education &amp; Work:</strong> Understand online courses or international meetings in foreign languages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Information: Free Trial &amp; Unlimited Use</strong><br>Live Translate offers you a <strong>free daily usage quota</strong> that resets every day. With this quota, you can try out the core features of the program immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For an unlimited and uninterrupted experience, simply enter your own <strong>OpenAI or Gemini API Key</strong> into the settings. This provides you with a personal and highest-quality translation experience.<br><i>(For help with API keys and setup, you can visit our Community Discussions.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also an excellent <strong>accessibility tool</strong> for users with hearing impairments, thanks to its clear and customizable subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Down Language Barriers: Translate Everything You See and Hear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Translate is a powerful AI tool that instantly converts everything from games and movies to live streams and any text on your screen into a language you understand. You no longer have to miss out on content just because you don't know the language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Can You Do with Live Translate?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Live Audio Translation:</strong> Captures any audio from your system (games, movies, streams) and turns it into live subtitles in over 50 languages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Screenshot (OCR) Translation:</strong> Instantly select and translate text from game interfaces, manga, webtoons, or images.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featured Use Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Games:</strong> Un-translated JRPGs, story-rich indie titles, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Media:</strong> Movies, series, anime, and documentaries without subtitles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Live Streams:</strong> Follow foreign Twitch and YouTube streamers in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Visual Novels:</strong> Easily read dialogues in manga, webtoons, and comics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Education &amp; Work:</strong> Understand online courses or international meetings in foreign languages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Information: Free Trial &amp; Unlimited Use</strong><br>Live Translate offers you a <strong>free daily usage quota</strong> that resets every day. With this quota, you can try out the core features of the program immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For an unlimited and uninterrupted experience, simply enter your own <strong>OpenAI or Gemini API Key</strong> into the settings. This provides you with a personal and highest-quality translation experience.<br><i>(For help with API keys and setup, you can visit our Community Discussions.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also an excellent <strong>accessibility tool</strong> for users with hearing impairments, thanks to its clear and customizable subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Live Translate provides real-time translation for games, videos, and chats. It captures system audio, translates into 50+ languages, and displays accessible subtitles for the hearing impaired on a customizable overlay. A perfect utility for gamers and multilingual users.",
